# tilescan, the tile scanner, its control window at 10 10 and the keys taken there: Meta-O (Alt) opens an image through the library's dialog
# (gpxtest.gif of the package, the dialog's field holding 50 characters; focus given back to the pointer first, the dialog pins it), the
# marquee starts on the whole image and its repeat window shows the tiling; Meta with the arrows shrinks the marquee (two lefts, two ups),
# the plain arrows move it (two rights, one down), Meta-M mirrors, and Meta-Q ends the program by itself
move 240 210
keydown Alt_L
key o
keyup Alt_L
wait
move 240 186
focus
press 1
release 1
type /home/corpus/packages/icon/ipl_gprogs/gpxtest.gif
wait
key Return
wait
move 60 60
keydown Alt_L
key Left
key Left
key Up
key Up
keyup Alt_L
wait
key Right
key Right
key Down
wait
keydown Alt_L
key m
keyup Alt_L
wait
keydown Alt_L
key q
keyup Alt_L
